From f4f57ee97bc97ef689d42d29c668fd1ec837f688 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Selfmuser <109387456+selfmusing@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 8 Sep 2025 22:01:41 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] [SQUASH]: Revert upstream changes which break 
 DOZE_TAP_SCREEN_GESTURE on legacy devices

Revert "Settings: Default DOZE_TAP_SCREEN_GESTURE to off [2/2]"

This reverts commit 689aa5605d057c52d0d42394a79bd12a88ff1d50.

Revert "Settings: Allow configuring wake sensors on ambient [2/2]"

This reverts commit 4161d56929fe5e2431e672a67572bcc7ed69df6a.

Revert "Settings: Allow configuring haptics for wake gestures [2/2]"

This reverts commit cd2b57454df3cb13491b3a7d2b1fd44c6a703596.

Revert "Settings: Allow ambient instead of waking on double tap as well [2/2]"

This reverts commit 4cc55be5643a94d08476ad285af1bea6cc358d9b.
